It drives robot vacuums running Valetudo (https://valetudo.cloud) through the
official REST API Valetudo serves on the local network. Nothing is sent to the
Internet.

This product includes material from the Valetudo project
(https://github.com/Hypfer/Valetudo), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0:
  - test/fixtures/map.json, a map of its test suite
    (backend/test/lib/robots/dreame/res/map/d9_1058_with_custom_named_segments.json);
  - the Valetudo logo used in the cover image (assets/logo/valetudo_logo_small.svg).
No Valetudo code was copied: the client follows the routes and entities of
its REST API.

